{"ID":"20240118145000-d5li6ra","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145000-d5li6ra","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145000-d5li6ra\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145000-wescd1v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165706-m4dlymx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165706-m4dlymx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:87,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:87\u0026#125;","title":"365补08饴糖","type":"doc","updated":"20240204161455"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145000-wescd1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145000-wescd1v","updated":"20240122165630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，乃以米麦制成者。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165632-wojnc3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165632-wojnc3m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165633-mywil75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165633-mywil75"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】饴糖为滋润肺脾，健胃补中要药，主补虚冷，益气力，治胃气枯燥，脾弱不运。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165635-5vgfo9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165635-5vgfo9t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主补虚乏，止渴，去血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165637-1ewbtzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165637-1ewbtzy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【思邈】补虚冷，益气力，止肠鸣咽痛，治唾血，消痰，润肺止嗽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165638-kz2byk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165638-kz2byk7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】健脾胃补中，治吐血，打损瘀血者熬焦酒服，能下恶血，又伤寒大毒嗽，于蔓青薤汁中煮一沸，顿服之良。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165640-uy3sr9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165640-uy3sr9u"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【宗奭】脾弱不思食人多用，能和胃气，亦用和药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165642-qfmc2j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165642-qfmc2j3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165644-vhacyey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165644-vhacyey"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】丹溪曰，饴属土，成于火，大发湿中之热，多食助脾风，能生胃火，此损齿之因，凡中满呕吐，酒病、牙疳，肾病及湿热证，不得轻投。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165631-pu3pajf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165631-pu3pajf"}},{"ID":"20240122165645-8ir9pom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165645-8ir9pom"}},{"ID":"20240122165645-r5ez3m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165645-r5ez3m5"}},{"ID":"20240122165650-zfb09pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165650-zfb09pg","updated":"20240204161222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第八个饴糖就是现在外面卖的麦芽糖，诸位呢如果你跑到夜市去买麦芽糖品质肯定不好，你要跑到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中药行去买麦芽糖那个最好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为那个中药的麦芽糖是品质挑过的，入药的麦芽糖的质最好，那这个麦芽糖呢平常，米麦制成的嘛用米麦慢慢熬出来的，味甘性温。这个麦芽糖饴糖就是麦芽糖滋润肺脾的药，健胃补中补虚冷，益气力。"}]},{"ID":"20240122165656-qd64xnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165656-qd64xnl","updated":"20240204161231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张仲景呢我们常常他在用建中汤里面放些饴糖，讲得就是麦芽糖，这个麦芽糖不是放进去煮。煮了就没有力量了，它已经熬过十二个小时以上了，有时候一天一夜熬出来，慢慢熬出来那个糖浆，那你是煮完汤药以后事后喝之前呢要加温，要把麦芽糖呢拿一勺进去融化一下，这是饴糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240122165701-79jr8a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165701-79jr8a1","updated":"20240204161317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那能够补虚乏，止渴，去血。所以一般来说是健脾胃的要药，很好吃很甜，那一般来说胃口如果不开，我们煮药的时候就会放一点饴糖下去，饴糖能够补中益气，当然"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不一定要建中汤，你平常的汤药里面病人气很虚的时候你都可以加些麦芽糖进去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，尤其是小朋友，小朋友喜欢吃甜的啊，苦的中药不要吃，你煮好汤药加点麦芽糖在里面他就很喜欢去喝啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240122165706-m4dlymx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165706-m4dlymx","updated":"20240204161455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个【禁忌】啊，它说麦芽糖吃多了会损齿啊这个要注意一下，那我们的蔗糖是健齿保护牙齿，麦芽糖的确会损伤牙齿因为它太粘了你知道，损齿的原因因为你这个粘了平常在吃啊煮汤药吃，一口喝下去融化在汤药里面没有关系可是在睡前有没有吃了麦芽糖嘴巴张开睡，什么虫子都跑进去啊，对啊那个麦芽糖好甜啊，对不对。"}]}]}